WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.120
- Hey, I'm Sadie Sink!

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:01.960
- And I'm Noah Schnapp!

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:03.980
- I'm Caleb McLaughlin.
- And I'm Gaten Matarazzo.

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:05.830
- I'm Finn Wolfhard, from
the show, Stranger Things.

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:07.690
- Everybody is excited for season three--

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:09.500
- Us included!
- But in case you haven't seen

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.700
seasons one and two, or you
just need a quick refresher,

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.390
we're here to catch you up
and get you nice and ready

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:14.223
for the new episodes.

00:00:14.223 --> 00:00:16.217
- Here we go.
(Caleb trilling)

00:00:16.217 --> 00:00:17.777
(both clicking)

00:00:17.777 --> 00:00:20.170
(electronic music)

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:22.000
- Super fast, here's a quick rundown

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.800
of all the important
characters in the series.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:25.970
- There's Mike, Will, Dustin, and Lucas,

00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:28.650
the most awesome one,
who are all best friends.

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:30.100
- Mike has a sister named Nancy

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:31.730
and Will has a brother named Jonathan.

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:34.410
Nancy's dating this really
cool guy named Steve Harrington

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:35.760
and is best friends with Barb.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:39.060
Will's mom is Joyce Byers and
the Hawkins chief of police

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:39.970
is Jim Hopper.

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:42.420
- Oh, we can't forget Eleven,
but we just call her El.

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:44.041
- Hawkins, Indiana, here we come.

00:00:44.041 --> 00:00:45.520
(electronic music)

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:46.881
- So season one opens
in Hawkins, where we see

00:00:46.881 --> 00:00:49.290
a big, scary laboratory,
something is clearly

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:50.810
going wrong, because alarms are going off

00:00:50.810 --> 00:00:52.270
and lab coat guys are panicking,

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:53.730
but we'll get back to
that, because right now,

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:55.610
our boys, Mike, Will, Lucas, and Dustin

00:00:55.610 --> 00:00:57.510
are playing a game of Dungeons and Dragons

00:00:57.510 --> 00:00:58.359
in Mike's basement.

00:00:58.359 --> 00:01:00.369
- [Mike] The Demogorgon!
(boys yelling)

00:01:00.369 --> 00:01:01.361
- We're in deep shit.

00:01:01.361 --> 00:01:02.820
- (coughing) Nerds.

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:03.653
- So anyways.

00:01:03.653 --> 00:01:05.310
- After the game, they
all go their separate ways

00:01:05.310 --> 00:01:07.140
and while biking home, Will gets attacked

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:09.050
by this scary monster that we can't see.

00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:09.883
Spooky.

00:01:09.883 --> 00:01:11.550
- Everyone starts freaking
out about Will missing,

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:13.340
but as the search goes on, we meet El,

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:15.260
a girl with a shaved
head in a hospital gown

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:16.330
who doesn't seem to speak,

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:19.270
and has some scary
Men-in-Black types after her.

00:01:19.270 --> 00:01:20.185
- You must be Benny Hammond.

00:01:20.185 --> 00:01:21.680
- I'm afraid I am.

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:23.950
- Who should she run into and
end up becoming friends with?

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:25.090
That's right, the boys.

00:01:25.090 --> 00:01:25.960
- Except for Will, of course.

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:27.209
- Yeah, he was busy at the time.

00:01:27.209 --> 00:01:28.042
- [Will] (On Phone) Mom?

00:01:28.042 --> 00:01:28.875
- Will?

00:01:28.875 --> 00:01:29.955
Anyway, while Will's
mom, Joyce, and Hopper

00:01:29.955 --> 00:01:31.960
are looking for Will, Nancy and Barb

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:33.580
go to a pool party at Steve's house.

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:35.770
And while Steve and Nancy
are kissing upstairs,

00:01:35.770 --> 00:01:37.089
the Demogorgon attacks Barb

00:01:37.089 --> 00:01:39.160
(monster roaring)

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:40.450
and brings her to the Upside Down.

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:42.450
- The Upside Down is a
mirror world of our own

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:44.940
except everything is awful
and creepy and ruled over

00:01:44.940 --> 00:01:46.899
by hideous monsters of unspeakable terror.

00:01:46.899 --> 00:01:48.170
(monstrous roaring)

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:50.400
But again, Eleven can
communicate between our world

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:51.940
and the Upside Down,
so that's pretty neat.

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:53.850
- Now, at this point, Will has figured out

00:01:53.850 --> 00:01:56.070
how to communicate with his
mom from the Upside Down

00:01:56.070 --> 00:01:57.810
using various Christmas lights

00:01:57.810 --> 00:01:59.400
which he can flick on and off.

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:01.430
- This leads to Joyce
covering the whole house

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:03.720
in tons of Christmas lights
and figuring out a system

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:05.860
of inter-dimensional
communication all her own.

00:02:05.860 --> 00:02:08.380
- Which makes her look like
an absolute crazy person.

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:09.213
She's not.

00:02:09.213 --> 00:02:10.820
- I don't care if anyone believes me!

00:02:10.820 --> 00:02:12.971
- Also, we get some gnarly
flashbacks that show us

00:02:12.971 --> 00:02:15.210
El was used in these terrible experiments

00:02:15.210 --> 00:02:16.560
where she's sent into the black void

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:17.710
at the lab near Hawkins.

00:02:17.710 --> 00:02:19.210
- Eventually, state troopers find

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:21.170
what appears to be
Will's body in the water

00:02:21.170 --> 00:02:22.330
of the local reservoir.

00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:24.720
As you'd imagine, everyone's
pretty shocked and upset.

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:26.842
- But Hopper, bless him, is suspicious.

00:02:26.842 --> 00:02:27.675
- Okay.

00:02:27.675 --> 00:02:28.808
(thwack)

00:02:28.808 --> 00:02:29.730
(thump)

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:30.640
- [Sadie] and discovers that

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:32.610
the tiny child's corpse in question

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:33.740
is just a stuffed dummy.

00:02:33.740 --> 00:02:34.770
Hate when that happens.

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:35.603
- Totally.

00:02:35.603 --> 00:02:37.080
- While the school has
this assembly for Will,

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:38.750
one of the bullies tries to fight Mike,

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:40.410
but Eleven, in disguise, of course,

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:42.540
stops him using her telepathic powers

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:44.420
and makes him pee his
pants in front of everyone.

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:45.920
- Dude, Troy peed himself!

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:47.540
- A fair, but brutal, punishment.

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:48.410
- Brutal, indeed.

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:50.360
So Hopper decides to
break into Hawkins Lab

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:51.630
to see what the hell is going on,

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:53.570
since they faked a
child death and whatnot.

00:02:53.570 --> 00:02:56.710
Unsurprisingly, he gets caught,
drugged, and returned home,

00:02:56.710 --> 00:02:57.840
where he wakes up and discovers

00:02:57.840 --> 00:02:59.620
several secret listening devices.

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:00.720
- The boys, along with El,

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:03.140
go looking for the
non-deceased Will in the woods,

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:04.640
as do Nancy and Jonathan.

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:07.080
Nancy gets stuck through a hole in a tree,

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:08.590
and then into the Upside Down,

00:03:08.590 --> 00:03:11.870
but Jonathan is able to pull
her back through the goo hole

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:13.670
before she gets barbed by the Demogorgon.

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:14.670
- Never say "goo hole".

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.388
- Will's mom, Joyce, and Sheriff Hopper -

00:03:16.388 --> 00:03:17.250
- Just Hopper.

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:19.746
- Right, Hopper and Joyce go
and find El's birth mother

00:03:19.746 --> 00:03:22.440
and get a better idea of what's
going down at Hawkins Lab.

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:24.880
Which clearly involves
kidnapping newborn babies

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:25.800
with cool powers.

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:27.870
- And the boys, out by the old quarry,

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:30.350
looking for answers, are
attacked by the pee pants bully,

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:32.180
Troy, who, despite having a knife

00:03:32.180 --> 00:03:33.780
and a lot of pent up anger -

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:34.613
- And sucks!

00:03:34.613 --> 00:03:36.869
- Gets his arm broken by El's mind.

00:03:36.869 --> 00:03:38.046
(crunching sound)

00:03:38.046 --> 00:03:38.879
(Troy screaming)

00:03:38.879 --> 00:03:40.360
[Sadie] Oh, and El also makes Mike fly.

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:41.770
Or, maybe should we just say hover?

00:03:41.770 --> 00:03:44.160
- [Finn] I can say that that
is awesome and very rad.

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:45.360
The squad from Hawkins Lab

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:47.850
knows about El hiding out
with the boys at Mike's house.

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:50.930
The "Bad Men" as they're called,
set out to kidnap her back.

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:53.750
Luckily, her superpower mind
is able to flip the vans over,

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:55.011
which rules very hard.

00:03:55.011 --> 00:03:55.844
(whooshing sound)

00:03:55.844 --> 00:03:56.677
(glass shattering)

00:03:56.677 --> 00:03:58.160
- Very, very hard.

00:03:58.160 --> 00:04:00.100
- Now the boys and El are in hiding,

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:01.450
and it's a full-on manhunt

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:03.500
from scary Bad Men in black suits.

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:05.100
Luckily, Hopper finds them first,

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:06.610
and the whole team concocts a plan

00:04:06.610 --> 00:04:08.510
to build a sensory deprivation tank

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:10.457
which will allow El to find
Will in the Upside Down.

00:04:10.457 --> 00:04:11.920
- [Mr. Clarke] What is this for?

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:12.753
- Fun.

00:04:12.753 --> 00:04:13.830
- El finds Will in the Upside down

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:15.960
using one of her classic
telepathic tricks,

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:17.610
and while the boys wait
with her in the gym,

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:19.700
Hopper and Joyce speed off to Hawkins Lab,

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:20.533
where they're convinced

00:04:20.533 --> 00:04:22.590
they'll be able to find the
entrance to the Upside Down.

00:04:22.590 --> 00:04:24.945
- Unsurprisingly, they're
caught almost immediately.

00:04:24.945 --> 00:04:26.310
[Security Officer] Don't move!

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:28.960
- [Finn] And taken to see the
head bad dude, Dr. Brenner.

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:30.450
Hopper convinces the lab guys

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:33.050
to let him and Joyce go into
the Upside Down and find Will

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:34.540
since the entrance is in the lab.

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:37.130
On the condition that
neither of them saw anything

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:38.990
or admit they they were
there in the first place.

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:40.070
- We're gonna find her son,

00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:42.530
and then we're gonna forget
that any of this ever happened.

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:43.880
- [Gaten] While all of this is happening,

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:44.713
Nancy and Jonathan,

00:04:44.713 --> 00:04:46.470
and an unwitting Steve
who is being a jerk,

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:47.810
have set up a trap for the monster,

00:04:47.810 --> 00:04:48.643
who they catch,

00:04:48.643 --> 00:04:50.710
and set on fire using a bear trap and gas,

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:51.543
as one does.

00:04:51.543 --> 00:04:53.560
(monstrous screeching, fire roaring)

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:55.680
- Unfortunately, when the fire goes out,

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:56.600
the monster is gone.

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:57.433
- [Nancy] Where'd it go?

00:04:57.433 --> 00:04:58.266
- Guess what?

00:04:58.266 --> 00:05:00.190
Government agents working with Hawkins Lab

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:02.220
find the kids at Hawkins Middle School,

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:03.053
- They found us.

00:05:03.053 --> 00:05:04.820
- And after El makes
their eyes start bleeding,

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:05.810
which is very cool,

00:05:05.810 --> 00:05:06.990
the monster smells blood

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:08.827
and is off to join everyone at the school.

00:05:08.827 --> 00:05:09.660
- Demogorgon!

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:10.493
(screeching)

00:05:10.493 --> 00:05:12.127
(bricks crumbling)

00:05:12.127 --> 00:05:14.570
- So the Demogorgon is
just busting up stuff,

00:05:14.570 --> 00:05:17.180
leaving a real mess of
bodies and school supplies

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:18.800
as the kids run around trying to stop it.

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:19.850
- In a final showdown,

00:05:19.850 --> 00:05:21.730
Lucas clumsily tries to find more rocks

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:23.040
to slingshot at the monster.

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:24.206
- Get the rocks! Get the
rocks! Get the rocks!

00:05:24.206 --> 00:05:25.290
- I am getting the rocks!

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:27.170
- El shows up, using
all the powers she has,

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:29.710
annihilates the hell out of
the Demogorgon, and it dies.

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:30.600
It's a horrible monster,

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:32.390
and it definitely ate
Barb alive, so it's fine.

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:34.690
- Sadly, though, El
disappears at this point, too,

00:05:34.690 --> 00:05:36.020
and nobody knows where she went.

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:37.960
But Joyce and Hopper find and rescue Will

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:38.830
from the Upside Down,

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:39.663
so that's good.

00:05:39.663 --> 00:05:41.210
- Smash cut to a few months later,

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:43.050
everything seems back to normal.

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:45.010
- Will is herald "The Boy Who Came Back",

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:47.355
but still seems to be slightly
affected by his ordeal.

00:05:47.355 --> 00:05:48.270
- Where am I?

00:05:48.270 --> 00:05:50.100
- He also burps up a black slug,

00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:51.360
which is probably not great.

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:52.490
- But on a more positive note,

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:55.290
we see a final scene where
Hopper treks off into the woods

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:57.190
and leaves a stash of Eggo Waffles,

00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:58.780
El's absolute favorite food,

00:05:58.780 --> 00:05:59.670
in a dropbox.

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:01.800
Leaving us on a hopeful
note we might see her again.

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:02.930
- And then -

00:06:02.930 --> 00:06:04.220
- We forgot to talk about the part where

00:06:04.220 --> 00:06:06.150
Jonathan beats the crap out of Steve,

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:06.983
- Kick his ass, man!

00:06:06.983 --> 00:06:07.816
- [Nancy] No, stop!

00:06:07.816 --> 00:06:08.649
(crunch)

00:06:08.649 --> 00:06:09.482
- But other than that-

00:06:09.482 --> 00:06:11.235
- That does it for Season
1, but what about Season 2?

00:06:11.235 --> 00:06:13.370
(funky music)

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:14.590
We've still got all the boys.

00:06:14.590 --> 00:06:16.610
We've got Will, Mike, Lucas, and Dustin,

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:18.273
Nancy, Steve, Jonathan, Hopper, Joyce,

00:06:18.273 --> 00:06:19.680
and, of course, Eleven.

00:06:19.680 --> 00:06:21.773
No more Barb, though, due to being eaten.

00:06:22.630 --> 00:06:23.463
- Yikes.

00:06:23.463 --> 00:06:24.810
And we also meet some new characters,

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:25.880
but we'll get to them in a bit.

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:27.470
- [Finn] We open on dark Pittsburgh,

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:29.850
where a group of masked
individuals are fleeing the police

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:31.500
and eventually are able to escape

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:34.110
because one of the people in
the group has special abilities

00:06:34.110 --> 00:06:36.520
to project images in the police's minds.

00:06:36.520 --> 00:06:37.353
In this case,

00:06:37.353 --> 00:06:39.194
a tunnel collapsing and
blocking the cops' way.

00:06:39.194 --> 00:06:40.027
(Tires screeching)

00:06:40.027 --> 00:06:40.860
(Sirens)

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:43.130
(Glass shattering)

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:45.280
- We see her nose bleeding
just like Eleven's does,

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:46.420
so that's probably connected.

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:48.700
The scene changes back to
good old Hawkins, Indiana,

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:50.100
where the boys are at the local arcade,

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:50.933
trying to figure out

00:06:50.933 --> 00:06:52.800
who the new high scores
on the machines belong to.

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:54.120
A mysterious character named Madmax.

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:55.430
- Cool name.

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:56.320
- Who's Madmax?

00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:57.153
- Better than you.

00:06:57.153 --> 00:06:58.140
- We also find out

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:00.770
that even though Will is
back from the Upside Down,

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:02.070
he's not all the way back.

00:07:02.070 --> 00:07:03.530
- He walks outside the arcade

00:07:03.530 --> 00:07:05.000
and is struck with the dark vision

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:06.930
of the horrifying shadow monster

00:07:06.930 --> 00:07:08.596
looming over the entire town.

00:07:08.596 --> 00:07:09.785
- Will,

00:07:09.785 --> 00:07:10.618
(gasp)

00:07:10.618 --> 00:07:11.451
- Are you okay?

00:07:11.451 --> 00:07:12.284
- It's no big deal.

00:07:12.284 --> 00:07:13.117
- Back at school,

00:07:13.117 --> 00:07:13.950
Nancy and Steve are still going steady,

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:16.690
and we meet two new transfer
students in from California.

00:07:16.690 --> 00:07:18.290
The devilishly handsome Billy,

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:20.790
and his step sister, a
young skater named Max.

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:22.160
- Like Madmax, maybe?

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:24.070
- Oh, and Joyce is now dating the manager

00:07:24.070 --> 00:07:25.350
of the local RadioShack.

00:07:25.350 --> 00:07:27.750
- Our old friend Hopper is
called out to the local farm

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:28.583
where he discovers

00:07:28.583 --> 00:07:30.980
all pumpkins are rotted
all the way through.

00:07:30.980 --> 00:07:33.480
- Will is seeing a doctor
from Hawkins Lab, Dr. Owens,

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:35.340
who's helping him deal with his PTSD.

00:07:35.340 --> 00:07:37.220
But we all know it's
something more than that.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:38.500
- Time for some good news.

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:40.670
It turns out El is alive and well,

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:44.030
and living with Hopper up in
a remote cabin in the woods.

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:44.950
- She's living in the woods,

00:07:44.950 --> 00:07:46.730
and getting extreme cabin fever.

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:48.440
And also occasionally visiting Mike

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:49.827
through her little void space

00:07:49.827 --> 00:07:50.660
(static) [Eleven] - Mike?

00:07:50.660 --> 00:07:51.493
- Because government bad guys

00:07:51.493 --> 00:07:52.940
are really looking hard for her,

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:54.590
even a year after her disappearance.

00:07:54.590 --> 00:07:56.210
- While the boys are trying their hardest

00:07:56.210 --> 00:07:57.340
to make friends with Max,

00:07:57.340 --> 00:07:58.700
Hopper heads into the woods

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:00.910
to explore more of the weird goo stuff

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:02.270
that is killing all the pumpkins.

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:04.960
And discovers that the problem
is seemingly emanating from,

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:05.980
yup, Hawkins Lab.

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:07.930
- Oh, and Nancy and
Steve have a huge fight

00:08:07.930 --> 00:08:08.860
at a Halloween party,

00:08:08.860 --> 00:08:09.860
and by the end of the night,

00:08:09.860 --> 00:08:11.530
it seems like she's
actually warming up more

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:12.718
to Will's older brother, Jonathan.

00:08:12.718 --> 00:08:14.280
- [Nancy] Jonathan?

00:08:14.280 --> 00:08:15.690
- While the boys are
out Trick-or-Treating,

00:08:15.690 --> 00:08:17.210
Will has another terrifying run-in

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:18.860
with the mysterious shadow monster.

00:08:18.860 --> 00:08:20.040
This time, in full view.

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:21.484
Gotta tell ya, it's pretty scary.

00:08:21.484 --> 00:08:23.810
(roaring)

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:25.860
- Meanwhile, El, who wasn't
allowed to Trick-or-Treat,

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:26.940
because it might expose her,

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:29.790
does her own void black
space trick to go see Mike,

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:30.850
who she misses a lot.

00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:31.683
- Mike?

00:08:31.683 --> 00:08:32.710
- After their Halloween night out,

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:33.840
Dustin returns home

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:36.440
to find some weird tiny
salamander-looking creature

00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:38.340
rummaging in his trash and adopts it.

00:08:38.340 --> 00:08:39.870
- What are you, little guy?

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:41.330
- And names it the natural choice

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:43.080
D'artagnan. Or, Dart for short.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:44.520
After the previous night's fight,

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:46.700
it really looks like Steve
and Nancy are done-zo.

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:47.570
History.

00:08:47.570 --> 00:08:48.403
Kaput.

00:08:48.403 --> 00:08:49.236
No more Stancy.

00:08:49.236 --> 00:08:50.069
- Whomp, whomp.

00:08:50.069 --> 00:08:52.260
- El, fully sick of being
cooped up in the cabin,

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:54.270
sets out on her own to find Mike

00:08:54.270 --> 00:08:56.000
and the rest of her friends at school.

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:56.940
- [Eleven] Where is school?

00:08:56.940 --> 00:08:58.080
- [Sadie] Where, coincidentally,

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:00.020
Dustin has managed to lose Dart.

00:09:00.020 --> 00:09:02.600
And we're still not entirely sure Dart is.

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:03.770
- While the boys look for Dart,

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:05.988
El sees Mike with Max
and runs away in tears.

00:09:05.988 --> 00:09:08.180
(thud) [Max] Ah!

00:09:08.180 --> 00:09:10.470
- And Will has yet
another horrifying run-in

00:09:10.470 --> 00:09:13.022
with the shadow monster, who
swiftly inhabits his body.

00:09:13.022 --> 00:09:14.890
(whooshing wind)

00:09:14.890 --> 00:09:16.570
Again, probably not a great thing.

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:17.990
- There's a weird rivalry going on

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:19.360
between Steve and Billy, too.

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:20.410
Cool guy drama, I guess.

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:22.384
- [Steve] Maybe you should
just shut up and play the game.

00:09:22.384 --> 00:09:23.217
(thud)

00:09:23.217 --> 00:09:25.260
- While Joyce and Hopper try to make sense

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:27.490
of these new drawings
that Will keeps making

00:09:27.490 --> 00:09:30.190
of the shadow monster and the
Upside Down world tunnels,

00:09:30.190 --> 00:09:33.050
Nancy and Jonathan are scooped
up by the government agents

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:35.385
for asking too many
snoopy teenage questions.

00:09:35.385 --> 00:09:36.600
- Let us out of here!

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:37.433
- But eventually,

00:09:37.433 --> 00:09:39.340
Dr. Owens decides to show them the portal

00:09:39.340 --> 00:09:40.210
to the Upside Down.

00:09:40.210 --> 00:09:42.330
In an attempt to get
them to shut the hell up.

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:43.770
- [Dr. Owens] We understand
each other now, don't we?

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:46.110
- Dustin has been keeping
Dart a secret from his friends

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:47.260
since he recaptured him,

00:09:47.260 --> 00:09:49.450
which, I'm sure he had a
perfectly goof reason for,

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:50.283
right?

00:09:50.283 --> 00:09:51.116
But, surprise surprise.

00:09:51.116 --> 00:09:52.970
- It turns out that
he's a baby Demogorgon.

00:09:52.970 --> 00:09:54.777
And he ate Dustin's family cat.

00:09:54.777 --> 00:09:56.790
(hissing)

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:57.623
Whoops.

00:09:57.623 --> 00:09:58.456
- And Hopper,

00:09:58.456 --> 00:10:00.210
who seems to have figured
out Will's cryptic maps,

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:03.110
starts digging in one of the
desiccated pumpkin patches

00:10:03.110 --> 00:10:05.440
and discovers an entrance
to the monster's tunnels.

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:07.610
And, of course, because
he's Hopper, he jumps on in.

00:10:07.610 --> 00:10:08.810
- He's a brave one, all right.

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:09.910
But he's also stupid.

00:10:09.910 --> 00:10:11.910
Because he almost immediately
gets knocked out by

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:13.116
monster gas, I guess?

00:10:13.116 --> 00:10:14.520
(Hopper coughing)

00:10:14.520 --> 00:10:17.390
Then, the tunnel, which seems
to be a part of the monster,

00:10:17.390 --> 00:10:18.646
starts enveloping him.

00:10:18.646 --> 00:10:20.400
(roaring) [Hopper] Wait, no! No! No!

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:21.410
But more on that later.

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:22.243
- Meanwhile, El,

00:10:22.243 --> 00:10:24.730
who discovered Hopper's
research on her origin,

00:10:24.730 --> 00:10:26.440
heads off to find her birth mother

00:10:26.440 --> 00:10:29.370
who we find almost completely
catatonic in a rocking chair.

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:30.443
Unable to communicate.

00:10:30.443 --> 00:10:32.130
- Sunflower. Rainbow.

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:32.963
- That's a bummer.

00:10:32.963 --> 00:10:34.470
Oh, and Nancy and Jonathan enlist the help

00:10:34.470 --> 00:10:36.670
of a wacky private
investigator, Murray Bauman,

00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:38.840
and end up hooking up at his weird garage.

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:40.980
- With help from Bob, who has
a real knack for puzzling,

00:10:40.980 --> 00:10:42.430
Joyce is able to find Hopper

00:10:42.430 --> 00:10:43.350
and is quickly joined

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:45.920
by scary dudes in E.T-looking
suits from Hawkins Lab,

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:47.060
who begin to burn the tunnel

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:49.920
because apparently the monster
absolutely hates warm stuff.

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:51.730
- One unfortunate side effect, however;

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:54.110
Will is clearly being
inhabited by the monster,

00:10:54.110 --> 00:10:57.580
as this tunnel-burning causes
him to convulse in pain, too.

00:10:57.580 --> 00:11:00.043
And honestly, he's been acting
super weird for awhile now.

00:11:00.043 --> 00:11:02.150
(screeching)

00:11:02.150 --> 00:11:03.820
- Dustin enlists our old friend Steve

00:11:03.820 --> 00:11:06.070
to help him capture the
now husky-sized Dart,

00:11:06.070 --> 00:11:07.790
who is trapped in the cellar of his house.

00:11:07.790 --> 00:11:08.790
- You ate my cat.

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:10.940
- But Dart is super strong and busted out.

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:11.773
- Uh-oh.

00:11:11.773 --> 00:11:13.460
With Will, Joyce, Hopper, and Bob

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:14.690
in the hospital recovering,

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:17.200
Dustin and Steve set out in
the woods to search for Dart.

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:18.340
And with the help of their friends,

00:11:18.340 --> 00:11:20.627
erect a kind of Demogorgon
fortress in the woods.

00:11:20.627 --> 00:11:22.420
Things do not go as planned.

00:11:22.420 --> 00:11:23.253
This is Stranger Things,

00:11:23.253 --> 00:11:24.140
what do you expect?

00:11:24.140 --> 00:11:25.670
- But, we do find out that Steve

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:27.320
is kind of a great babysitter.

00:11:27.320 --> 00:11:30.095
In ways that only a Hawkins
babysitter would need to be.

00:11:30.095 --> 00:11:31.470
(roaring) [Steve] You want some?

00:11:31.470 --> 00:11:33.853
(screeching) Get back!

00:11:33.853 --> 00:11:34.686
- I still can't believe

00:11:34.686 --> 00:11:36.960
Max's family moved into this bonkers town.

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:37.793
- Oh, come on.

00:11:37.793 --> 00:11:38.626
You love it.

00:11:38.626 --> 00:11:39.880
- While all this is happening, Will,

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:42.240
now operating as a kind
of spy for the monster,

00:11:42.240 --> 00:11:45.020
which, in true D&amp;D style
is called the Mind Flayer,

00:11:45.020 --> 00:11:47.160
summons armies of Demodogs to the hospital

00:11:47.160 --> 00:11:48.840
with great ominousness, I might add.

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:49.673
- It made me do it.

00:11:49.673 --> 00:11:50.506
(screeching)

00:11:50.506 --> 00:11:52.740
- We take a break from the
storyline to rejoin El,

00:11:52.740 --> 00:11:54.220
who discovered from her mother

00:11:54.220 --> 00:11:55.900
that there are other kids like her,

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:58.120
and sets off to find them on another bus.

00:11:58.120 --> 00:11:59.500
- She ends up in the big city,

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:01.160
and eventually finds her sister,

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:03.270
who is the girl from Season 2, Episode 1,

00:12:03.270 --> 00:12:04.800
with the gang of masked folks.

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:05.920
- The gang of misfits

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:08.300
encourages El to work
on developing her powers

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:10.279
and eventually enlists
her help in their mission.

00:12:10.279 --> 00:12:12.800
- Shirley Temple is
gonna get us all killed.

00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:15.280
- Which is to kill
everyone involved with El

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:17.350
and her sister's torture
as young children.

00:12:17.350 --> 00:12:18.540
A vendetta, if you will.

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:20.120
Don't cross badass girls, I guess.

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:22.210
- But El isn't really
big on the murder thing,

00:12:22.210 --> 00:12:24.460
and, eventually, sensing
trouble back in Hawkins,

00:12:24.460 --> 00:12:25.560
parts ways with the crew

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:27.790
and heads back home
again on a Greyhound bus.

00:12:27.790 --> 00:12:28.710
- Back to the hospital,

00:12:28.710 --> 00:12:30.960
where dozens of
Demogorgons have broken out

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:32.900
and are ripping apart
scientists and soldiers

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:33.733
all over the place.

00:12:33.733 --> 00:12:35.180
It's just a full-on blood bath.

00:12:35.180 --> 00:12:36.780
- Oh yeah. Bad news all around.

00:12:36.780 --> 00:12:38.970
Hopper, Joyce, Bob, Mike, and Dr. Owens

00:12:38.970 --> 00:12:41.050
are running around trying
to avoid the monsters,

00:12:41.050 --> 00:12:42.680
but also have to put Will to sleep

00:12:42.680 --> 00:12:43.530
because he's a straight up

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:45.387
shadow monster Kapo at this point.

00:12:45.387 --> 00:12:48.130
- He's lying! He's lying! He's lying!

00:12:48.130 --> 00:12:50.070
- Just when it seems
like everyone's screwed,

00:12:50.070 --> 00:12:51.870
80's technology genius Bob

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:54.270
sneaks past the monster
hoard to the security room,

00:12:54.270 --> 00:12:56.540
where he successfully
opens up a path to escape

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:57.430
for the rest of the crew.

00:12:57.430 --> 00:12:58.263
Way to go, Bob!

00:12:58.263 --> 00:13:00.500
- Tragically, Bob suffers a hero's fate,

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:03.646
and gets gruesomely disemboweled
by a group of Demodogs.

00:13:03.646 --> 00:13:04.479
- [Bob] No!

00:13:04.479 --> 00:13:06.530
- (Joyce screaming)

00:13:06.530 --> 00:13:08.000
- You're with Barb now, Bob.

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:10.550
The surviving gang escape
back to the Byers' house,

00:13:10.550 --> 00:13:13.185
but are eventually set
upon by more Demodogs

00:13:13.185 --> 00:13:14.710
- That's not good.

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:16.160
- They just can't catch a break.

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:18.150
- But just as they prepare
to go down fighting,

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:20.378
a limp Demodog corpse
flies through the window.

00:13:20.378 --> 00:13:21.290
(glass shattering)

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:22.830
(screaming)

00:13:22.830 --> 00:13:24.030
- [Gaten] Heralding the return of,

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:24.863
you guessed it,

00:13:24.863 --> 00:13:25.696
Eleven.

00:13:25.696 --> 00:13:26.529
As Hopper leaves with El,

00:13:26.529 --> 00:13:27.970
Steve is charged with
babysitting the kids,

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:29.020
which, he is, again, very good at.

00:13:29.020 --> 00:13:31.080
- Does everybody understand that?

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:31.980
- Babysitter Steve.

00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:32.813
Mom steve!

00:13:32.813 --> 00:13:35.840
- Alas, an irate Billy
comes by looking for Max,

00:13:35.840 --> 00:13:37.908
and he and Steve end up in an epic fight.

00:13:37.908 --> 00:13:38.741
(glass breaking)

00:13:38.741 --> 00:13:41.210
One that is actually ended by Max,

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:42.590
who threatens to nail bat Billy.

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:44.581
- I guess that's why they
call her "Mad"max, huh?

00:13:44.581 --> 00:13:45.440
(bat whooshing)

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:47.080
- Joyce, Jonathan, and Nancy

00:13:47.080 --> 00:13:49.550
try to exorcize the
shadow monster from Will

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:51.450
before it completely consumes him.

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:53.870
Using the only weapon they know hurts him.

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:54.703
Heat.

00:13:54.703 --> 00:13:55.536
(monstrous screeching)

00:13:55.536 --> 00:13:56.930
(wood breaking, hissing)

00:13:56.930 --> 00:13:58.040
- Meanwhile, Steve and the kids

00:13:58.040 --> 00:13:59.030
head down to the tunnels

00:13:59.030 --> 00:14:01.350
to try and burn up the
monster with some gasoline.

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:02.500
Hard to imagine they'll be able

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:05.070
to do what a bunch of soldiers
with flame throwers couldn't,

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:06.470
but you gotta admire their pluck.

00:14:06.470 --> 00:14:07.303
- And, of course,

00:14:07.303 --> 00:14:09.660
no monster could be fully
defeated without El,

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:12.680
who, alongside Hopper, descends
into Hawkins Lab's gate.

00:14:12.680 --> 00:14:15.380
And as Hopper fires off a
machine gun at the Demodogs

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:16.740
swarming all around them,

00:14:16.740 --> 00:14:17.750
El uses her powers

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:19.837
to fully close the gate
beneath Hawkins Lab.

00:14:19.837 --> 00:14:20.749
(monstrous screeching)

00:14:20.749 --> 00:14:23.010
(Eleven screaming)

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:24.370
- Bye bye, mister Mind Flayer,

00:14:24.370 --> 00:14:25.250
way to go, El.

00:14:25.250 --> 00:14:26.180
- Cut to a month later,

00:14:26.180 --> 00:14:27.013
where the government

00:14:27.013 --> 00:14:28.410
finally was forced to admit their role

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:29.790
in the death of Barb and Bob,

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:31.570
and Hawkins lab is shut down for good.

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:33.580
- And as a nice little
wrap-up for our heroes,

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:35.810
all the kids end up at
the school's Snow Ball,

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:38.540
where Dustin has a,
let's say "new" hairdo.

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:41.080
El shows up looking very
dolled up to dance with Mike,

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:42.760
and, oh, they finally kiss.

00:14:42.760 --> 00:14:44.770
- And, oh, Lucas and Max are a couple now.

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:46.200
Pretty damn cute if you ask me.

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:48.320
- Unfortunately, in true Hawkins form,

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:49.460
the final shot warns

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:52.130
that stuff is about to get
extremely real for the kids

00:14:52.130 --> 00:14:52.963
in Season 3.

00:14:52.963 --> 00:14:54.018
(thunder)

00:14:54.018 --> 00:14:55.420
(lightning cracks)

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:56.720
- Anywho, now that you're all caught up,

00:14:56.720 --> 00:14:57.670
you're ready to dive into Season 3.

00:14:57.670 --> 00:14:58.896
- That was good.

00:14:58.896 --> 00:14:59.729
(clap)

00:14:59.729 --> 00:15:00.640
- Check it out on Netflix.

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:03.140
(jazzy music)

